    290914577
   ],
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Y-You did WHAT? ... N-No... So it's you who... I... How could you do that to {D}!? H-How could {M} do that!?",
   "settings": {
